 ## Background
-Transient Progressive Photon Beams was introduced in the paper "Progressive Transient Photon Beams" [S1]. It extends the concept of Progressive Photon Beam Mapping to the transient domain, addressing the challenges of time-resolved light transport. The method is particularly relevant for applications such as time-of-flight imaging and non-line-of-sight reconstruction.
